  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the diced turkey ham and cook until it is lightly browned.",
    "Add the basmati rice and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and stir in the pitted dates.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
